            "title": "Nvidia Earnings In Focus Following Jensen Huang's Ouster Amid Affair Controversies",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\">Get ahead of the market by subscribing to Seeking Alpha's Wall Street Week Ahead, a preview of key events scheduled for the coming week. The newsletter keeps you informed of the biggest stories set to make headlines, including upcoming IPOs, investor days, earnings reports, and conference presentations.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The stock market rose on Friday as the PPI inflation rose less than expected in October, while investors assessed the fallout from Jensen Huang's exit from NVIDIA. The U.S. Producer Price Index rose 0.3% M/M in October, vs. +0.4% consensus and +1.4% recorded in the prior month (revised from +1.3%), according to data released by the U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics on Friday.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The coming week will kick off with the Federal Reserve’s chair Kevin Warsh’s speech on Monday, followed by retail sales data scheduled for Tuesday. Crude oil inventories data is due on Wednesday. On Thursday, the Fed will release the FOMC meeting minutes, with the Philadelphia Fed manufacturing index for November and initial jobless claims also scheduled for the day. Friday’s economic calendar is relatively free, barring speeches from FOMC member Thomas Barkin and Governor Michael Barr.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Major tech firms like NVIDIA and Palo Alto Networks are due to report earnings next week alongside other bigwigs, including Alibaba, Walmart, and Baidu.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">______________________________________________________________</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Monday: Baidu (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BIDU\" title=\"Baidu, Inc.\">BIDU</a>), XPeng (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/XPEV\" title=\"XPeng Inc.\">XPEV</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\" target=\"_blank\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Tuesday: NVIDIA (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVDA\" title=\"NVIDIA Corporation\">NVDA</a>), Home Depot (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HD\" title=\"The Home Depot, Inc.\">HD</a>), and Walt Disney (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DIS\" title=\"The Walt Disney Company\">DIS</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\" target=\"_blank\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Wednesday: Palo Alto Networks (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PANW\" title=\"Palo Alto Networks, Inc.\">PANW</a>), Target (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TGT\" title=\"Target Corporation\">TGT</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\" target=\"_blank\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Thursday: Walmart (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WMT\" title=\"Walmart Inc.\">WMT</a>), Alibaba (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BABA\" title=\"Alibaba Group Holding Limited\">BABA</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\" target=\"_blank\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Volatility watch:</b> NVIDIA, Micron (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MU\" title=\"Micron Technology, Inc.\">MU</a>), and Intel (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INTC\" title=\"Intel Corporation\">INTC</a>) have seen options volatility increase over the last week. The most overbought stocks per their 14-day Relative Strength Index include Ultralife (</p></body></html>",
